// audit-ci configuration for @midstream/wasm (npm-wasm).
//
// Why this file exists:
//   npm-wasm depends on agentic-flow@2.0.12-fix.8 (pinned RUNTIME dep, QUIC
//   transport). Its transitive tree carries high/critical advisories whose
//   ONLY npm-suggested fix is a semver-MAJOR downgrade to agentic-flow@1.9.0
//   -- a breaking regression of the QUIC runtime that cannot be verified in
//   CI. Cleanly-fixable advisories are already floored to patched, same-major
//   versions via the "overrides" block in package.json (genuine fixes, no
//   suppression). The advisories listed below have no non-breaking fix and are
//   accepted as documented, tracked risk per maintainer decision on PR #26.
//
//   Scope: high + critical only (skip-dev: true -> production deps only).
//   This is an ID-scoped allowlist: any NEW advisory in this tree will fail
//   the gate and force a fresh review -- it does not blanket-ignore the tree.
//
//   REVIEW BY: 2026-09-28 (re-evaluate when agentic-flow ships a fixed line).
//   See also: ../.trivyignore (mirror for the Trivy scanner).
{
  "$schema": "https://github.com/IBM/audit-ci/raw/main/docs/schema.json",
  "high": true,
  "skip-dev": true,
  "allowlist": [
